      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "51. 异分母分数的加法和减法"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "问题. 玛沙用$\\frac{3}{10}$小时做数学作业，用$\\frac{4}{15}$小时做俄语作业.",
        "玛沙做作业用了多少分钟？"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "为了解这个题，要把$\\frac{3}{10}$和$\\frac{4}{15}$加起来. 我们已经学会了同",
        "分母分数的加法. 因此，为了把$\\frac{3}{10}$和$\\frac{4}{15}$加起来，必须先通分，",
        "比如取60作公分母，然后把通分后的分数加起来：",
        "$\\frac{3}{10}+\\frac{4}{15}=\\frac{18}{60}+\\frac{16}{60}=\\frac{34}{60}$."
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "因为$\\frac{34}{60}$小时=34分钟，所以玛沙做作业用了34分钟."
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": true,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "这样，异分母的两个分数相加，必须先把这些分数通分，"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "foot",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "216"
      ]
    }
  ]
